&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 555px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;東和電気株式会社（現：ユニプラ㈱）の株式取得&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 19px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 90px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;1962年４月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 555px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;神奈川県大和市に大和工場を新設&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 19px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 90px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 54px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;９月&lt;/p&gt;
