&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;指&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;委&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;員&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;会&lt;/p&gt;
